    "text": "Preview: Run a program on the hosted service and stream it until it finishes, detaches or the deadline passes.\nSummary: model model-sol-legacy; inputs audience, topic\nEffect: starts a paid run\nHold: $1.02 (set aside from the wallet while the run is live; not its price)\nNothing was changed.\n"
